### 📄 Document & Medical Image Intelligence

- Upload PDF reports for AI analysis
- Automatic PDF text extraction
- Upload JPG, JPEG and PNG medical images
- AI-assisted medical image analysis
- Multimodal AI workflow for document and image inputs
- File type and file size validation
- Support for uploading multiple documents/images in the interface
- One-document-at-a-time AI analysis for reliable model processing
- Extracted document context can be passed directly to the AI assistant
- Uploaded files are processed temporarily for analysis and are not permanently stored

### 🧠 Multimodal AI Assistant

The CRM assistant goes beyond database-based question answering by supporting document and image analysis.

Users can:

- Upload PDF reports and extract their text automatically
- Upload medical images such as X-rays for AI-assisted visual analysis
- Ask questions about uploaded documents
- Ask the AI to summarize extracted reports
- Combine CRM context with uploaded document context when relevant
- Analyze images using a vision-capable Groq model
- Receive structured, conversational responses directly inside the CRM chatbot

The system validates uploaded files before processing and provides user-friendly feedback for unsupported or oversized files.

