## 🔍 How It Works

### CRM Interaction Workflow

1. Medical Representative logs a doctor interaction.
2. Interaction details are validated and stored in PostgreSQL.
3. LangGraph orchestrates the AI workflow.
4. Groq LLM generates:
   - Professional interaction summary
   - Recommended next action
   - Follow-up email
   - Priority level
5. Dashboard statistics update using the stored CRM data.
6. The AI CRM Assistant retrieves relevant CRM interaction context to answer user questions.

### Document & Image Analysis Workflow

1. User uploads a PDF or supported medical image through the chatbot.
2. FastAPI validates the uploaded file.
3. PDF documents are processed using PDF text extraction.
4. Images are prepared for multimodal AI analysis.
5. Relevant document/image context is passed to the vision-capable LLM.
6. The AI generates an analysis based on the uploaded content.
7. The result is displayed directly inside the conversational CRM assistant.

Uploaded documents and images are processed temporarily for analysis and are not persisted as CRM records.

⚙️ Installation
Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yogicharan2828-coder/AI-CRM-PROJ.git

Navigate to the project directory

cd AI-CRM-PROJ
Backend Setup
cd backend

python -m venv venv

venv\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn app.main:app --reload
Frontend Setup
cd ../frontend

npm install

npm run dev

Open in your browser

http://localhost:5173

🔑 Environment Variables

Create a .env file inside the backend folder.

DATABASE_URL=your_postgresql_connection_string

GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key

